{"id":"ef65263e9dc11c66","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-profinite-zero.md","title":"Profinite Zero","display":"Profinite Zero","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-profinite-zero","aliases":["93-fact-profinite-zero"],"display":"Profinite Zero","depends_on":["[[93-df-profinite]]","[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-profinite-zero"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-profinite-zero</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Profinite Zero"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f5dec406c92aa2e\" href=\"?note=2f5dec406c92aa2e\" title=\"93-df-profinite\">93-df-profinite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\">\\(\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\in|\\mathbf A|\">\\(\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\in|\\mathbf A|\\)</span> is the Boolean bottom element and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}\\)</span> is the order of its lattice reduct.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\land\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl[\\forall x\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}x)\n\\land\\forall z\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(\n(\\forall x\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;z\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}x)\n\\to z=\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\land\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl[\\forall x\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}x)\n\\land\\forall z\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(\n(\\forall x\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;z\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}x)\n\\to z=\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The bottom element exists and is unique because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is a Boolean\nalgebra.  Profinite presentation preserves it coordinatewise, but\ntopological compactness is not needed for this conclusion.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-profinite","status":"resolved","id":"2f5dec406c92aa2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-profinite]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolalg]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\in|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle;\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\land\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl[\\forall x\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}x)\n\\land\\forall z\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(\n(\\forall x\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;z\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}x)\n\\to z=\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false}],"bytes":1208,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["2f5dec406c92aa2e","757a95a2c335d9fb","7087f500cc845c3b"]}